### CPUT Home POC — core workflow (VS Code REST Client or copy as curl)
### 1. register a student
# @name register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Demo Student",
  "email": "221000001@mycput.ac.za",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "STUDENT",
  "studentNumber": "221000001",
  "campus": "Bellville"
}

### 2. login (paste the token below as {{token}})
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "221000001@mycput.ac.za",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. approved public search (guest works too)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings?campus=Bellville&maxPrice=4000&sort=priority&size=20

### 4. emergency rooms only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings?emergency=true&size=20

### 5. landlord creates (needs a verified landlord token)
# @name create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sample House Bellville",
  "description": "decent place near campus",
  "location": "Bellville",
  "campus": "Bellville",
  "rooms": [{ "roomType": "Single", "monthlyRent": 2800, "beds": 1 }]
}

### 6. admin approves (use the id from step 5)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/listings/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. student messages the landlord (use a visible listing id)
# @name message
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "is october open?"
}

### 8. read the thread back
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1/messages?studentId=221000001@mycput.ac.za
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. inbox
GET http://localhost:8080/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
